#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "With ``--use-docker``, a machine that"
#~ " has no local installation runs the"
#~ " application in a container instead —"
#~ " one container per application, named "
#~ "after it (``partcad-freecad``, ``partcad-"
#~ "blender``, ``partcad-gazebo``, ``partcad-"
#~ "mujoco``, ``partcad-kicad``), created from "
#~ "the application's image (``--docker-image``"
#~ " overrides it; FreeCAD's is "
#~ "``linuxserver/freecad:latest``, since the FreeCAD"
#~ " project publishes no image of its"
#~ " own, Blender's is ``linuxserver/blender:latest``"
#~ " for the same reason, KiCad's is "
#~ "the ``ghcr.io/partcad/partcad-container-kicad`` "
#~ "image PartCAD already builds for "
#~ "``kicad`` parts, and an engine's is "
#~ "whatever its plugin package declares) "
#~ "the first time and reused afterwards,"
#~ " so a container you have prepared "
#~ "keeps being the one that is used."
#~ " Without ``--use-docker``, a machine "
#~ "with neither the application nor Docker"
#~ " is told so rather than being "
#~ "left with a command that quietly "
#~ "did nothing. Remove the application's "
#~ "own container (``docker rm -f "
#~ "partcad-freecad``, ``partcad-blender``, "
#~ "``partcad-gazebo``, ``partcad-mujoco``, "
#~ "``partcad-kicad``) to have the next "
#~ "``pc open`` create a fresh one. "
#~ "The workspace and the directory holding"
#~ " this workspace's daemon socket are "
#~ "mounted **at the paths they have "
#~ "on the host**, which is what lets"
#~ " one path mean the same thing "
#~ "on both sides. A file that is "
#~ "not in this workspace gets its own"
#~ " workspace mounted instead, so that "
#~ "whatever is mounted always contains the"
#~ " file the application is handed; a"
#~ " container created for one workspace "
#~ "and then used from another says "
#~ "so, and says to remove it, rather"
#~ " than opening a name the container"
#~ " cannot resolve."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "带上 ``--use-docker`` "
#~ "时，没有本地安装的机器会改为在容器中运行该应用程序——每个应用程序一个容器，并以它命名（ ``partcad-"
#~ "freecad`` 、 ``partcad-blender`` 、 "
#~ "``partcad-gazebo`` 、 ``partcad-mujoco`` 、"
#~ " ``partcad-kicad`` ），首次运行时从该应用程序的镜像创建（ "
#~ "``--docker-image`` 可以覆盖它；FreeCAD 用的是 "
#~ "``linuxserver/freecad:latest`` ，因为 FreeCAD "
#~ "项目没有发布自己的镜像，Blender 出于同样的原因用 "
#~ "``linuxserver/blender:latest`` ，KiCad 用的是 PartCAD"
#~ " 本就为 ``kicad`` 零件构建的 ``ghcr.io/partcad"
#~ "/partcad-container-kicad`` "
#~ "镜像，而某个引擎用的则是它的插件包所声明的镜像），之后一直复用，因此你准备好的容器会始终是被使用的那一个。不带 "
#~ "``--use-docker`` 时，一台既没有该应用程序也没有 Docker "
#~ "的机器会收到明确的说明，而不是执行了一条悄无声息什么也没做的命令。删除该应用程序自己的容器（ ``docker rm"
#~ " -f partcad-freecad`` 、 ``partcad-"
#~ "blender`` 、 ``partcad-gazebo`` 、 "
#~ "``partcad-mujoco`` 、 ``partcad-kicad`` "
#~ "），下一次 ``pc open`` 就会创建一个全新的。工作区以及存放本工作区守护进程套接字的目录，都会"
#~ " **挂载到它们在宿主机上的路径** "
#~ "，正是这一点让同一个路径在两边含义相同。不在本工作区中的文件，会改为挂载它自己所属的工作区，这样被挂载的内容总是包含交给应用程序的那个文件；为某个工作区创建、却从另一个工作区使用的容器会如实说明这一点，并提示把它删除，而不是去打开一个容器无法解析的名字。"

